# Always Push and Deploy

After completing any requested code change on this project:

1. Create a git commit (follow the repo commit-message style).
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch (`git push -u origin HEAD` if needed).
3. Rely on Netlify auto-deploy from the pushed commit (`netlify.toml` build).

Do this without waiting to be asked again. Do not force-push to main/master.
